# 行尾策略：多平台协作时防止「整文件 diff」噪音
#
# 背景：Windows 的 git 默认 core.autocrlf=true 会把检出的 LF 换成 CRLF，
# 再提交时又转回 LF——但只要有一个队友的配置不同，同一份 .v 文件就会在
# 仓库里出现「全部行都变了」的假 diff，评审时完全看不出真实改动。
# 这里统一：**仓库内一律 LF**，二进制文件不做任何转换。

# 默认：文本文件入库统一 LF
* text=auto eol=lf

# 硬件描述与脚本：强制 LF（TD/Quartus/ModelSim 都能正常读）
*.v        text eol=lf
*.sv       text eol=lf
*.svh      text eol=lf
*.vh       text eol=lf
*.vhd      text eol=lf
*.vhdl     text eol=lf
*.tdf      text eol=lf
*.xdc      text eol=lf
*.sdc      text eol=lf
*.qsf      text eol=lf
*.qpf      text eol=lf
*.f        text eol=lf
*.do       text eol=lf
*.tcl      text eol=lf
*.py       text eol=lf
*.mjs      text eol=lf
*.js       text eol=lf
*.ts       text eol=lf
*.json     text eol=lf
*.yml      text eol=lf
*.yaml     text eol=lf
*.md       text eol=lf
*.txt      text eol=lf
*.bat      text eol=crlf
*.cmd      text eol=crlf
*.ps1      text eol=crlf

# 二进制：禁止任何转换与 diff
*.bit      binary
*.bin      binary
*.rbf      binary
*.fs       binary
*.png      binary
*.jpg      binary
*.jpeg     binary
*.gif      binary
*.pdf      binary
*.zip      binary
*.7z       binary
*.ppt      binary
*.pptx     binary
*.doc      binary
*.docx     binary
*.xls      binary
*.xlsx     binary
*.mp4      binary
*.wav      binary
*.db       binary
*.qdb      binary
*.wlf      binary

# 语言统计：这些是生成/参考资料，不计入仓库语言占比
docs/**     linguist-documentation
assets/**   linguist-documentation
